{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118473","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118473/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118473/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118473/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118473","id":4246557113,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HVG5","number":118473,"title":"RigidBody2D separates from CollisionShape2D and is invisible in editor","user":{"login":"asperkraken","id":59842712,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODQyNzEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59842712?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken","html_url":"https://github.com/asperkraken","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asperkraken/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:47:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T09:21:44Z","closed_at":"2026-05-05T09:21:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6 and up, Godot Physics engine\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 64-bit stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nA RigidBody, after being Frozen in Static Mode, despite being a Static Body, if moved, will separate from its CollisionShape2D resource. \n\nThis CollisionShape2D is not visible in editor even with Collision Shapes Visible checked on despite the original still showing with its Rigid-now-Static Body.\n\nHow to reproduce: create a RigidBody and put its Freeze Mode to Static Mode. After freezing it, change its position - even after setting linear velocity and angular velocity to zero. \n\nIf you try to move, say, a CharacterBody or RigidBody into the space where the freeze mode bool flip occurred, despite the parent moving (a sprite will stay attached for instance), the CollisionShape2D still effects the area. It's as if they split. You cannot see this CollisionShape in editor with the option to see Collisions turned on.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Make a RigidBody 2D. Give it a sprite for visual reference.\n- Set freeze mode on RigidBody2D to Static Mode.\n- Create an Area2D and have it signal to freeze the RigidBody2D upon entry. After it enters and becomes static, move it.\n- Turn Collision Shapes Visible in the editor. Feel free to use StaticBody2Ds and Tilesets for reference. both of mine were visible.\n- Move the RigidBody2D into the Area2D and execute the freeze and move. All objects move but the CollisionShape which continues to act as a StaticBody but separate from its owner and invisible.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118473/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0